<main class="gg-page">
  <section class="gg-hero gg-hero-new">
    <div class="gg-hero-copy">
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Built by three college students</p>
      <h1>A garden for the goals you are still trying to grow.</h1>
      <p>
        Goal Grower turns habits and long-term goals into plants you care for.
        Water them with small actions, grow shared gardens, and keep coming back.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-actions">
        <a href="/pages/contact#testing" class="gg-btn gg-btn-dark">Join beta testing</a>
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn gg-btn-light">Fund the project</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-hero-lab">
      <div class="gg-lab-note gg-lab-note-one">made by real students</div>
      <div class="gg-lab-note gg-lab-note-two">built from small progress</div>

      <div class="gg-lab-card gg-lab-card-main">
        <span>Today’s Garden</span>
        <div class="gg-plant"></div>
        <h3>Morning Stretch</h3>
        <p>Watered 4 days this week</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="story" class="gg-overlap-story">
    <div class="gg-overlap-intro">
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Why it exists</p>
      <h2>Goal Grower is built around returning.</h2>
      <p>
        Not perfect streaks. Not guilt. Just a small living reminder that the goal
        is still worth caring for.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-overlap-stage">
      <article class="gg-overlap-card gg-overlap-dark">
        <div>
          <p class="gg-eyebrow">01 / The feeling</p>
          <h2>Goals should feel <span>alive</span></h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Most apps turn your life into another list. Goal Grower gives your effort a shape.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="gg-overlap-card gg-overlap-charcoal">
        <div>
          <p class="gg-eyebrow">02 / Real life</p>
          <h2>Life gets <span>busy</span></h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          School, work, stress, missed days, and unfinished plans are part of the design.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="gg-overlap-card gg-overlap-green">
        <div>
          <p class="gg-eyebrow">03 / Growth</p>
          <h2>Plant. Water. <span>Return.</span></h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          One small action keeps the plant alive. You can always come back.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="gg-overlap-card gg-overlap-paper">
        <div>
          <p class="gg-eyebrow">04 / Together</p>
          <h2>Grow with <span>people</span></h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Shared gardens let friends, family, classmates, and teams grow side by side.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-loop-section">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2>A small loop for real life.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-loop-grid">
      <div class="gg-loop-card">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Plant</h3>
        <p>Create a habit or long-term goal.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-loop-card">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Water</h3>
        <p>Complete one small action.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-loop-card">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Grow</h3>
        <p>Watch your plant change over time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-loop-card">
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Share</h3>
        <p>Build shared gardens with others.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-testing">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Beta testing</p>
      <h2>Help us test Goal Grower before launch.</h2>
      <p>
        Leave your email to get testing links, early access, and build updates.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-email-card">
      {% form 'customer', class: 'gg-email-form' %}
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="Goal Grower Beta Tester">

        <label for="GoalGrowerEmail">Email for beta testing</label>

        <div class="gg-email-row">
          <input
            id="GoalGrowerEmail"
            type="email"
            name="contact[email]"
            placeholder="you@example.com"
            required
          >
          <button type="submit">Join list</button>
        </div>

        {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
          <p class="gg-form-success">Thank you. You are on the testing list.</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if form.errors %}
          <p class="gg-form-error">Please check your email and try again.</p>
        {% endif %}
      {% endform %}

      <p class="gg-email-note">No spam. Just testing and launch updates.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-human-section">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">The build</p>
      <h2>Not a giant company. Just three students trying to make something useful.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-human-grid">
      <div class="gg-human-card">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Built in public</h3>
        <p>We want users to see the project grow while it is still imperfect.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-human-card">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Feedback shaped</h3>
        <p>Beta testers help decide what feels helpful, confusing, or missing.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-human-card">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Made to return to</h3>
        <p>The app is designed around restarting, not shame.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-about-band">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">About us</p>
      <h2>Three college students building something real.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is being designed, tested, and improved by a small student
        team learning how to build a real app and business.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href="/pages/about-goal-grower" class="gg-btn gg-btn-light">Meet the team</a>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-fund">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Fund the project</p>
      <h2>Support the next version.</h2>
      <p>
        Support helps cover testing, app store costs, design, development,
        and the tools needed to keep Goal Grower moving.
      </p>
      <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn gg-btn-light">Support development</a>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-fund-card">
      <h3>Support helps with</h3>
      <div><span>01</span><p>Testing and publishing costs</p></div>
      <div><span>02</span><p>Shared gardens and reminders</p></div>
      <div><span>03</span><p>Better onboarding and tutorials</p></div>
      <div><span>04</span><p>Keeping a student-built project alive</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-store">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Store</p>
      <h2>Merch and tools that help fund the app.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower merch, journals, desk tools, tech accessories, and small
        products can support development.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-store-grid">
      <a href="/collections/goal-grower" class="gg-product-card">
        <div class="gg-product-image"></div>
        <span>Merch</span>
        <h3>Goal Grower apparel</h3>
        <p>Simple merch connected to the app.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/stationery" class="gg-product-card">
        <div class="gg-product-image"></div>
        <span>Desk</span>
        <h3>Journals and planners</h3>
        <p>Offline tools for goals and ideas.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/tech" class="gg-product-card">
        <div class="gg-product-image"></div>
        <span>Tech</span>
        <h3>Focus accessories</h3>
        <p>Small products for calmer routines.</p>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-center-action">
      <a href="/pages/goal-grower-store" class="gg-btn gg-btn-dark">Visit store page</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-contact-band">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Feedback</p>
      <h2>Tell us what would make this better.</h2>
      <p>
        Send feature ideas, bugs, testing questions, store questions, or general feedback.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn gg-btn-dark">Contact us</a>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-faq">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">FAQ</p>
      <h2>Questions before you join.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-faq-list">
      <details>
        <summary>Is Goal Grower available yet?</summary>
        <p>It is currently in development and beta testing.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Who is building it?</summary>
        <p>Goal Grower is being built by three college students through Ziyu Development.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Can I give feedback?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Use the contact page to send feedback, ideas, bugs, or testing questions.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Do purchases support the app?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Store purchases and support contributions help fund development.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-final">
    <div>
      <h2>Start with one small seed.</h2>
      <p>Join the testing list and help shape Goal Grower before launch.</p>
      <a href="/pages/contact#testing" class="gg-btn gg-btn-dark">Join beta testing</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Goal Grower Home",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Goal Grower Home"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}